think Opened on the rota (pull clean, roster COLD in flight), surveyed the lane by five parallel readers, and the crux named itself: the optimization spine (active-designing/20260826-021136), five bounded moves proposed and none seated. This lap seats moves one, two, and five; the Caravan Door semi-standfast rides the same room-touch.
think Move one, the room law: the whole-room census read ten modulo sites -- eight divisibility predicates that wrap nothing, two genuine wraps. Both classified with invariant comments naming wrap-as-periodic (queue.rye slot_offset: a sequence lands on a ring slot on purpose; reply.rye: a method ordinal cycles a fixture table). The law's meter is tools/fixtures/caravan_wrap_class_scan.sh, POSIX-portable from birth under the morning's dialect lesson, and tools/ca/caravan_wrap_class_witness.rish proves three claims on metal: the room whole and SEEN (classified=2, a meter finding nothing proves nothing), a planted unclassified wrap refused by name in a pen, and the honest shapes free. Born registered in the choir -- roster bijection 112=112.
think Move two: mask.rye's word-wide law held only through the max_turn_steps alias; the direct comptime assert max_queue_len <= 32 now stands beside it with its why, so the law survives the alias's retirement. Move five: the wafer rehearsal plan names Caravan its first consumer, the falsifier working on paper. Moves three (replayable drain) and four (offset from index) stand next, named on the card.
think Rishi taught two seams the hard way: backslash escapes pass through its strings (a quoted-dollar wore literal quotes; double-backslash-n printed as characters), and a percent inside a printf format is a directive -- the sibling idiom (bare mktemp, single backslash-n, text as %s arguments) is the portable spelling. Six Meter-opening caravan files (refusal_reason_test, restart_on_ok, service, subscribe_poll_service, supervisor_exit, supervisor_signal) gained plain Door first sentences, elder facts kept in their bodies.
obs Council rota: N=3492 read row 2 again (the commit-count skip %223 names), so the row advanced by hand to 3, Water -- care and flow, the row that tastes. The lap drank its own medicine: the swallow was both witnesses on metal, the law grew from ten real sites rather than imagined ones, and the happy zone holds -- each witness one bounded claim in a pen.
obs Honest silt for the earth lap: caravan_suite stays machine-gated on this bench (vendor gitlinks refuse this session's network path -- %237's standing fact, retried twice today), so the choir's whole-song waits for a hand or the pier; and the rehearsal plan's Caravan paragraph is design prose, not yet a module.
